        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1814_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1814_Lane3" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1814_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1814_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1814_Start5" name="Capex request approved (W1813)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1814_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1814_Task6" name="FP&amp;A allocates approved budget to capex project: (a) breaks down total budget…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FP&amp;A allocates approved budget to capex project: (a) breaks down total budget by cost category: construction, equipment, materials, services, contingency, (b) assigns entity: which of the 5 legal entities bears the cost, (c) links to funding source: retained earnings, bank loan, lease financing
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1814_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1814_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1814_Task7" name="committed">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System tracks committed costs: (a) committed: POs issued for the project (not yet received/invoiced), (b) incurred: invoices received and matched to PO/GR, (c) paid: payments made to vendors/contractors, (d) remaining budget: approved budget − committed − incurred, (e) forecast to complete: Project Manager estimate of remaining costs
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): FP&amp;A
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1814_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1814_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1814_Task8" name="Monthly: FP&amp;A reviews all active capex projects: (a) budget utilization (%…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Monthly: FP&amp;A reviews all active capex projects: (a) budget utilization (% spent vs. % complete), (b) cost variance (actual vs. budget at current completion), (c) schedule variance (actual vs. planned milestones), (d) forecast to complete vs. remaining budget, (e) flag: projects trending &gt; 110% of budget
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1–2 days/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1814_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1814_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1814_Task9" name="Quarterly: CFO presents capex portfolio status to Board: (a) total capex spent…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Quarterly: CFO presents capex portfolio status to Board: (a) total capex spent vs. annual budget, (b) major project updates (new stores, DC, IT), (c) budget overruns and corrective actions, (d) revised full-year capex forecast
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1814_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1814_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1814_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1814_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1814_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-210 (ensure capex authorization &amp; commitment control.) | - operational: FP&amp;A review and approval gate
Owner: FP&amp;A</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
