    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W1817" name="W1817. Capex Requisition to Purchase Order Conversion" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Capex request approved (W1813); procurement ready to proceed
Frequency: ~30–50 PO conversions/year (multiple POs per project)
Volume: ~100–200 capex POs/year
Owner: Procurement
Participants: Procurement, Project Manager, Department Head
Source: workflow W1817 — Capex Requisition to Purchase Order Conversion</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1817_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1817_Lane1" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1817_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1817_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1817_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1817_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1817_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1817_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1817_Start4" name="Capex request approved (W1813); procurement ready to proceed">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1817_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1817_Task5" name="Procurement converts approved capex request to purchase requisition: (a) breaks…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Procurement converts approved capex request to purchase requisition: (a) breaks project into procurement packages (construction, equipment, services), (b) each package becomes a separate PO with vendor, items, quantities, prices, (c) PO references capex project number for cost tracking
Responsible (R): Procurement
Accountable (A): Department Head
Duration: 1–3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1817_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1817_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1817_Task6" name="Procurement sources vendors per standard procurement process: (a) competitive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement sources vendors per standard procurement process: (a) competitive bid for items &gt; PHP 500K (minimum 3 quotes), (b) negotiated contract for construction (per VS-03), (c) select best value (not just lowest cost — consider quality, timeline, warranty), (d) PO issued with delivery terms aligned to project timeline
Responsible (R): Procurement
Accountable (A): Department Head
Duration: 1–4 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1817_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1817_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1817_Task7" name="PO linked to capex project: (a) system auto-commits PO amount against project…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PO linked to capex project: (a) system auto-commits PO amount against project budget, (b) project budget report shows: committed (POs), incurred (invoices), remaining, (c) PO approval per standard DOA (not capex DOA — PO approver verifies that capex project exists and has budget)
Responsible (R): System / Procurement
Accountable (A): FP&amp;A
Duration: Per PO</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1817_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1817_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1817_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1817_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1817_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-361 (ensure controlled execution — Capital Expenditure Request &amp; Approval (PA-40.1).) | - operational: Procurement review and approval gate
Owner: Procurement</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1817_Assoc10" sourceRef="W1817_Annotation9" targetRef="W1817_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1817_Flow11" sourceRef="W1817_Start4" targetRef="W1817_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1817_Flow12" sourceRef="W1817_Task5" targetRef="W1817_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1817_Flow13" sourceRef="W1817_Task6" targetRef="W1817_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1817_Flow14" sourceRef="W1817_Task7" targetRef="W1817_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W1817_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W1817_plane" bpmnElement="W_W1817">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1817_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W1817_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1817_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W1817_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
